Date:   Fri Mar 27 20:05:51 2020 +0000

    ALTERNATIVE_KERNELS: Fix renameVar warnings on multilib
    
    Starting with commit 06b2c82a43 ("bitbake: data: Don't allow renameVar
    calls with equivalent keys") from bitbake core repo, there a new warning
    is implemented when trying to call python renameVar function with same
    values/keys:
    bb.warn("Calling renameVar with equivalent keys (%s) is invalid" % key)
    
    multilib.bbclass is using rename_package_variables functions defined in
    meta/lib/oe/classextend.py to rename the package name by adding the
    multilib prefix (lib32/64, libx32):
    self.d.renameVar("%s_%s" % (subs, pkg_mapping[0]), "%s_%s" % (subs, pkg_mapping[1]))
    
    This function is calling the bitbake core function renameVar which raise
    the warning if a variable is intended to be renamed with the same name.
    
    The moment when this happens in meta-intel-axxia is when renaming the
    KERNEL_PACKAGE_NAME variable for alternative kernels. Only the
    virtual/kernel provider should have the value "kernel", all the
    alternative kernels have "kernel-${PN}". But somehow the parser is
    checking in renameVar function also if the first part of the value
    matches the one we want to rename and it raises warnings. So, if we
    want to rename kernel with kernel-linux-intel-rt, warnings will raise.
    
    To void this, all the alternative kernels will have for KERNEL_PACKAGE_NAME
    variable the value "altkernel-${PN}".
    
    Warnings fragment:
    ...
    WARNING: meta-intel-axxia/meta-intel-snr/recipes-kernel/linux/linux-yocto-rt-debug_5.4.bb:
    Calling renameVar with equivalent keys (pkg_postinst_kernel-lib32-linux-yocto-rt-debug-image-bzimage) is invalid
    WARNING: meta-intel-axxia/meta-intel-snr/recipes-kernel/linux/linux-yocto-rt-debug_5.4.bb:
    Calling renameVar with equivalent keys (pkg_postrm_kernel-lib32-linux-yocto-rt-debug-image-bzimage) is invalid
    WARNING: meta-intel-axxia/meta-intel-snr/recipes-kernel/linux/linux-yocto-rt-debug_5.4.bb:
    Calling renameVar with equivalent keys (pkg_postinst_ontarget_kernel-lib32-linux-yocto-rt-debug-image-bzimage) is invalid
    WARNING: meta-intel-axxia/meta-intel-snr/recipes-kernel/linux/linux-yocto-rt-debug_5.4.bb:
    Calling renameVar with equivalent keys (INITSCRIPT_NAME_kernel-lib32-linux-yocto-rt-debug-image-bzimage) is invalid
    WARNING: meta-intel-axxia/meta-intel-snr/recipes-kernel/linux/linux-yocto-rt-debug_5.4.bb:
    Calling renameVar with equivalent keys (INITSCRIPT_PARAMS_kernel-lib32-linux-yocto-rt-debug-image-bzimage) is invalid
    ...
    
    Signed-off-by: Daniel Dragomir <Daniel.Dragomir@windriver.com>

